InfosProjection = The projection function is a simulation of the next results.<br>To work, the module 'Margins' has to be enable, the extrafields 'Cost price' of contract services and if necessary the extrafields 'Already spent' of sales orders have to be filled.<br><br> - Revenue (orders) : Sum of the remaining unbilled orders divided by the number of remaining periods<br> - Revenue (contracts) : Sum of total amount of the contracts divided by 12 months<br> - Projected fixed costs : Average of the fixed costs on the past period<br> - Projected variable costs : Average of cost price of the contracts + average of the remaining cost price to spend of the sales orders<br>Projected profit / loss : Difference between total of revenues and total of costs.<br><br>* If you updated Easydashboard from a version < 3.0, you should deactivate/activate the module to create the extrafields.
